 Doves are the crown's finest."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Caralynn","Nerys","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2",["Believes Nerys Silvarenne, a first-year in her dorm, is her most devoted fan, because of the flowers that keep arriving."]],["Caralynn","Nerys","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4@Nerys",["Caralynn Veyturone, also Fire, believes Nerys is a devoted fan because of the flowers that keep arriving; Nerys has not corrected her."]],["Caralynn","Ruby","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:1",["Ruby Bonbon plays guitar behind her in the Music Club and is perfectly happy back there, which Caralynn finds infuriating: she cannot provoke her, cannot impress her, and has no idea what to do with someone who will not compete."]],["Caralynn","Ruby","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:0@Ruby",["Music Club, where she plays guitar and is perfectly happy to stay at the back behind Caralynn Veyturone.","Caralynn Veyturone sings lead in the Music Club while Ruby plays guitar behind her, and cannot provoke her, which is infuriating."]],["Caralynn","Wren","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2",["Wren Marlowe, a deaf first-year in her dorm, sits on the floor at every Music Club rehearsal feeling the songs through the boards, and applauds harder than anyone."]],["Caralynn","Wren","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4@Wren",["Caralynn Veyturone sings lead in the Music Club; Wren cannot hear a note of it, sits on the floor at every rehearsal feeling it through the boards, and applauds harder than anyone, and Caralynn cannot decide whether this is the greatest compliment she has ever had or an insult."]],["Caspian","Aiden","protective",["protective"],"rank:4",["Covers for first-year troublemaker Aiden Ruzzo too."]],["Caspian","Aiden","protective",["protective"],"rank:4@Aiden",["Caspian Riwalo covers for him."]],["Caspian","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Caspian","Etnie","protective",["protective"],"rank:2@Etnie",["Caspian Riwalo, her 