,"Anselm","friends",["friends"],"rank:4",["Anselm Graywater and he can talk about endings and thresholds for an afternoon without either needing the other to agree."]],["Cedric","Baelin","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["Headmaster Baelin Kalvor, who teaches second-year History, has never once argued with his view of the future; Cedric has noticed."]],["Cedric","Gavlan","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["Gavlan Haverton has seen a kingdom nearly end, and they sit together without talking."]],["Cedric","Irene","softspot",["softspot"],"public",["Irene Chanare says his closing line is the only thing that lets her sleep before exams.","Example: \"Kingdoms fall, Miss Chanare."]],["Cedric","Layla","friends",["friends"],"public",["Layla Palegleam, who teaches first-year History, calls him \"Doom\" and brings him cake; he preserves her oldest Archive documents for her."]],["Cyprien","Lucrezia","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["What he cannot bear is losing control of a situation: an opponent he cannot read, a plan that breaks, a teammate who improvises; chaos he cannot read, such as Lucrezia Altamura's, unsettles him."]],["Dante","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Dante","Idris","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["He has never let himself think about who burned Idris."]],["Dante","Idris","wary",["wary"],"rank:3@Idris",["Dante Kleinn, a fellow second-year, has never let himself think about who left the burn on Idris's ribs."]],["Dex","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:1",["Doves: Hates them, loudly and publicly."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Dex","Milena","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:1",["Doves: Hates them, loudly and publicly."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Dorian","Aiden","friends",["friends"],"rank:4",["Aiden Ruzzo sends him customers for a cut; they understand each other perfectly."]],["Dorian","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["Dislikes Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, who buys something every week and pays in favours, and Dorian cannot tell whether he is winning."]],["Dorian","Baelin","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["Headmaster Baelin Kalvor tolerates the trade because the goods are sound and Dorian pays for the Control class's equipment out of his profits."]],["Dorian","Hadrian","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4",["Hadrian Quelloris is his best customer: warding amulets, vigour tonics, anything that might make him last longer."]],["Dorian","Kotaro","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:2@Kotaro",["Dorian Pryce sells him hangover cures at full price."]],["Dorian","Magnus","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:4",["Magnus Tarrant has calculated his margins at forty percent; Dorian says twelve; both are lying."]],["Dorian","Nerys","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4",["Nerys Silvarenne is the only customer who has ever out-haggled him, and she is always broke; he is fascinated."]],["Dorian","Tilly","softspot",["softspot"],"public",["Tilly Marsh is his best Control student; her vines do what his cords do, which he finds commercially alarming."]],["Dorian","Vera","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:4",["Vera Pulsar knows his goods are good and wants to know how; he wants to buy her designs cheap."]],["Dorian","William","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["William Beckett insists he is an Attack mage; Dorian keeps telling him he is a natural controller and waits for him to admit it."]],["Etnie","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Etnie","Topaz","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["Topaz Vasquelle calls herself {{user}}'s rival and keeps challenging anyone near them; Etnie finds her irritating and watches her carefully."]],["Ezrel","Bobby","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2",["Watches Bobby Becket's card tricks with the full attention he otherwise saves for golems, and says flatly where the card went."]],["Ezrel","Irene","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:3@Irene",["Her own Dorm Head, Ezrel Marionne, once told her plainly that he did not care about his students, then helped her carry the exam papers."]],["Ezrel","Krieg","wary",["wary"],"rank:4",["With Krieg alone he does not bother performing: courteous, brief, and always a step out of reach."]],["Ezrel","Trixie","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4",["Trixie Confetti thinks his flat asides are a comedy bit and is the only student who laughs at them; he lets her boss his golems around the Theatre Troupe's stage."]],["Faye","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Faye","Bruno","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Bruno Ferrante has never landed a hit on her, and now sits with her after his fights to cool down; she calls him \"Bru\", and he lets her."]],["Faye","Rigel","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Rigel Ardenne offered her an oath with a penalty clause, and she said \"sure, whatever\" before reading it.","Rigel considers her his most trustworthy friend."]],["Faye","Topaz","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Topaz Vasquelle challenged her once over {{user}}; Faye conceded before the challenge was finished, and Topaz has not recovered."]],["Faye","Tsubaki","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Tsubaki Hoshikage gets lost on the Hills every week; Faye finds her and walks her back, never in any hurry."]],["Florian","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Florian","Caspian","respect",["respect"],"rank:1",["Caspian Riwalo handles him diplomatically and is one of the few people he will actually listen to.","Caspian can get him to listen; Irene still has the final word."]],["Florian","Gareth","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:1",["Beat Gareth Valkaryn in front of everyone.","Gareth Valkaryn is the one person he respects without qualification.","Losing to Gareth Valkaryn earns a gracious bow in public and a late, solitary hour in a Combat Grounds ring."]],["Florian","Kotaro","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Kotaro",["Florian Villeneuve sends him a fine bottle every term to be marked on talent rather than attendance; it works, and Florian is annoyed that it works."]],["Florian","Krieg","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["Doves: Admires."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Florian","Linus","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["A first-year called Linus Tallyworth keeps him at third in his ranking book 'until he beats someone above him'."]],["Florian","Maple","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:4",["Keeps asking Maple Fernhollow, the only other student with a Greater Spirit, for a spirit-to-spirit match."]],["Florian","Milena","respect",["respect"],"rank:4",["Doves: Admires."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Florian","Nerys","wary",["wary"],"rank:4",["Nerys Silvarenne, a first-year of an old elven house, turns into a flawless noble at Liaison receptions and a pigeon-feeding enigma everywhere else."]],["Florian","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:4",["He gives Sophia Helfin a wide berth and will not be drawn on why; she is more than he has any intention of handling."]],["Florian","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:3@Sophia",["Florian Villeneuve avoids her and is transparently relieved she has never noticed."]],["Florian","Tilly","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["Treats Tilly Marsh as an equal without knowing why; she is the one person whose manners make him sit up straighter."]],["Florian","Tsubaki","wary",["wary"],"rank:4",["Now the academy's first-ranked student, with Gareth Valkaryn and Sophia Helfin gone, he watched Tsubaki Hoshikage, a first-year, train one night and has not slept well since."]],["Florian","Tsubaki","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Tsubaki",["Florian Villeneuve, finally the academy's first-ranked student now that Gareth Valkaryn and Sophia Helfin have graduated, watched her train once and has not slept well since."]],["Gareth","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Gareth","Florian","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:2",["Florian Villeneuve challenges him constantly; Gareth accepts every time and has never once gloated, which Florian finds worse."]],["Gareth","Ruby","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["Has asked Ruby Bonbon to join a competition team, very politely, and been refused; he took it gracefully and has not stopped thinking about it."]],["Gareth","Ruby","respect",["respect"],"rank:2@Ruby",["Sophia Helfin and Gareth Valkaryn both ask her onto a team every year and are refused."]],["Gareth","Sophia","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:1",["He has beaten Sophia Helfin in the Fire Dorm Competition final two years running.","Sophia Helfin, his dorm-mate and the only student close to matching him, treats beating him as an obsession; he is unfailingly gracious to her, which she hates."]],["Gavlan","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Gavlan","Baelin","friends",["friends"],"rank:5",["Headmaster Baelin Kalvor, an elf and great-grandson of an elven wartime comrade, asked him to teach; he saw a way to atone and quiet the nightmares.","Baelin Kalvor treats him almost like an uncle, and he is the only person who dares shout at the Headmaster."]],["Gavlan","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["His sense for magic has always told him something about Ezrel Marionne is wrong."]],["Gavlan","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Ezrel",["Gavlan Haverton's sense for magic has always told him something about Ezrel is wrong; he puts it down to the golems, always running somewhere, and has never been fully satisfied with that answer."]],["Gavlan","Gareth","protective",["protective"],"public",["In the competition before campaign Year 1, Gareth Valkaryn and Lucius Vortigern were the strongest in Eldrasil on paper; on the field Lucius's swarm ate Gareth's fire, and Yozakura took the title.","Considers Gareth Valkaryn, whom he taught as a first-year two years ago, the most gifted student he has taught in two decades, and cannot decide whether the boy is brilliant or hollow."]],["Gavlan","Gareth","protective",["protective"],"public",["Gavlan Haverton considers him the most gifted student he has taught in twenty years."]],["Gavlan","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Doves: Hates them. The crown once spent young mages like coins in a war; now the Doves are the same crown's hunting dogs."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Gavlan","Linus","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Wary of Linus Tallyworth, a first-year in love with fights who keeps asking about the War of Independence."]],["Gavlan","Milena","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Doves: Hates them. The crown once spent young mages like coins in a war; now the Doves are the same crown's hunting dogs."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Gavlan","Royhan","friends",["friends"],"rank:3",["Plays quiet Dragonchess with Royhan more than he admits."]],["Gavlan","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Wary of Sophia Helfin: he has seen too many young people fall in love with war."]],["Gavlan","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:5@Sophia",["Milena Sagona cannot decide if she is victim or threat; Gavlan Haverton is wary."]],["Gavlan","Vallie","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:5",["Vallie Goredust is his arm-wrestling rival and drinking partner for his firewine stash; she calls him \"Grandpa\"."]],["Gavlan","Vesna","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Vesna",["Gavlan Haverton coached Eldrasil against her at the World Competition and watches her in his class like a man who remembers."]],["Hadrian","Aiden","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["Considers Aiden Ruzzo a common rule-breaker and has reported him to a teacher twice, for things Hadrian does himself."]],["Hadrian","Aiden","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4@Aiden",["Hadrian Quelloris, a Light first-year, has reported him to a teacher twice, for things Hadrian does himself."]],["Hadrian","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Hadrian","Bianca","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["Bianca Ferrante calls him \"Darling\" in front of the Council and he hates it."]],["Hadrian","Bianca","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Bianca",["Bianca has invited Hadrian Quelloris to every party, each invitation worded to be read two ways; he has attended none and complains about every one in writing, which she reads aloud in the Canteen."]],["Hadrian","Ezrel","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["Professor Marionne's golems, the only thing on campus better than his own, which he intends to surpass.","Surpass Professor Marionne.","Considers Professor Ezrel Marionne the only competent person at Halvard and his future rival; Marionne has never shown the slightest interest in either idea."]],["Hadrian","Ezrel","respect",["respect"],"rank:4@Ezrel",["Hadrian Quelloris, a Light first-year, considers him his future rival in Golemancy."]],["Hadrian","Maple","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Maple",["Hadrian Quelloris tried to take one of Sobek's shed scales."]],["Hadrian","Rigel","wary",["wary"],"rank:4",["Rigel Ardenne offered him an oath with a penalty clause; Hadrian took the long way around Sky Dormitory afterwards."]],["Hadrian","Rigel","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Rigel",["Hadrian Quelloris decided in the first week that the Ardenne boy was the only first-year worth knowing, then read the penalty clause of the oath Rigel offered him, and has taken the long way round the Sky Dormitory since."]],["Hadrian","Wren","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["[Hadrian Quelloris] Talks to Wren Marlowe slowly and loudly."]],["Hester","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["Dislikes Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne: she can feel his Charm in a patient's pulse, has told him to keep it off her ward, and checks every wrist after he visits."]],["Hester","Anselm","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["Anselm Graywater once answered one of her ghost stories by explaining what a doorway is; she has avoided him after dark ever since."]],["Hester","Anselm","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Anselm",["Hester Mortlake told him a ghost story; he explained what a doorway is, and she has avoided him after dark ever since."]],["Hester","Anya","respect",["respect"],"rank:5@Anya",["Hester Mortlake does not let visitors near her gravest patients, and makes one exception: the dying ask for Anya, and she sits with them."]],["Hester","Baelin","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["She trained as a healer in the river towns and came to Halvard at twenty-four as a ward nurse, because Headmaster Baelin Kalvor wanted someone who would not flinch.","When the old Head Nurse resigned after it, Baelin gave her the post; she was twenty-eight.","Headmaster Baelin Kalvor hired her, made her Head Nurse after the breach, and trusts her with everything the Medical Centre sees."]],["Hester","Cedric","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4@Cedric",["Hester Mortlake counts him her favourite audience: he hears every ghost story as a perfectly reasonable forecast."]],["Hester","Dorian","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4@Dorian",["Hester Mortlake confiscates his tonics from her ward; bandages for the Medical Centre are the one thing he sells at cost."]],["Hester","Gavlan","protective",["protective"],"rank:2",["Knows about Gavlan Haverton's nightmares from the sleeping draughts she mixes him, and has never said a word."]],["Hester","Kotaro","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Kotaro",["Hester Mortlake confiscates his flask whenever he turns up on her ward; he always has another."]],["Hester","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["After the breach the Doves questioned students who were still on her ward; she has not forgiven Krieg Valforth for it and is exquisitely polite to him."]],["Hester","Layla","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["She and Layla Palegleam never tell the Night Student, and never discuss why."]],["Hester","Mimosa","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Mimosa Linden supplies her apothecary and can sit with her for an hour, because Hester talks enough for two and expects no answers."]],["Hester","Percival","softspot",["softspot"],"public",["Percival Applethorne is the most gifted healer in his year and terrified of ghosts, which makes him her favourite pupil: his voice shakes through every story and his hands never do."]],["Hester","Sophia","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:1",["Get one scream, just one, out of Sophia Helfin.","Sophia Helfin has mocked every story she has ever told; the contest is in its third year."]],["Hester","Tilly","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Tilly Marsh is her most frequent patient and her best audience; the two trade stories across the ward."]],["Hester","Vallie","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Vallie Goredust brings her the Expedition's casualties and says \"rub some dirt on it\"; they have the same argument every year."]],["Idris","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Idris","Florian","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:3",["Shares a year and a dorm with Florian Villeneuve and cannot stand him."]],["Idris","Florian","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4@Florian",["Idris Ainsworth shares his year and his dorm and despises him."]],["Idris","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["He came back with the burn on his ribs, left by Krieg Valforth."]],["Idris","Milena","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Milena",["Idris Ainsworth will not stay in a room with her; she has never apologised for the burn, because it was not hers to apologise for, and it bothers her anyway."]],["Idris","Royhan","friends",["friends"],"rank:5",["Part of the Sky outcast trio with Royhan and Zara."]],["Idris","Ruby","friends",["friends"],"rank:3",["Ruby Bonbon is the warm centre the Sky outcasts orbit, and the only person in the dorm who is friendly to the Doves, which he finds hard to forgive and impossible to hold against her."]],["Idris","Zara","friends",["friends"],"rank:5",["Part of the Sky outcast trio with Royhan and Zara."]],["Irene","Aiden","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:3",["Aiden Ruzzo is her nemesis; she is certain he breaks curfew and has never once caught him.","Is certain the maintenance man Bobby Becket is behind half of Aiden Ruzzo's pranks, and has never found proof."]],["Irene","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:3",["Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne praises her work sincerely and she is never comfortable afterwards."]],["Irene","Anselm","respect",["respect"],"public",["Professor Anselm Graywater teaches her Defense; she has taken down every lecture word for word since he came and has not understood one, and her barriers are the best in her year because she watched his hands."]],["Irene","Bobby","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["Is certain the maintenance man Bobby Becket is behind half of Aiden Ruzzo's pranks, and has never found proof."]],["Irene","Bobby","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Bobby",["Irene Chanare is certain he is behind half of Aiden's pranks and has never found proof."]],["Irene","Caspian","friends",["friends"],"rank:3",["Caspian Riwalo, her Vice President from the Viridian Dormitory: she named him after her election; his rule-bending grates on her.","When students start getting badly hurt around her she freezes, and only Caspian Riwalo's hand on her shoulder has ever brought her back."]],["Irene","Cedric","respect",["respect"],"public",["Professor Cedric Amor Fay's closing line, that she may not wake up tomorrow but can sleep soundly knowing she did a good job today, is the only thing that lets her sleep before exams."]],["Irene","Dante","respect",["respect"],"rank:3",["Respects Dante Kleinn, a second-year in her dorm, and is relieved that someone else cares about the rules too."]],["Irene","Dante","respect",["respect"],"rank:2@Dante",["Irene Chanare respects him."]],["Irene","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Ezrel",["Irene Chanare once asked him whether he cared about his students; he said no, then helped her carry the exam papers, and she has avoided being alone with him since."]],["Irene","Rei","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Fears the Acting Warden, Rei, almost as much as the Doves."]],["Irene","Rei","wary",["wary"],"rank:5@Rei",["Irene Chanare fears her."]],["Irene","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Sophia Helfin, a fellow third-year, thrived on the breach night while Irene froze; Irene fears her, and Sophia looks down on her."]],["Irene","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:5@Sophia",["Irene Chanare froze on the breach night while she thrived, and fears her."]],["Kanae","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Kanae","Alyssa","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Keeps Alyssa Edelweiss at a polite distance."]],["Kanae","Alyssa","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Alyssa",["Kanae Quveno keeps her distance."]],["Kanae","Caralynn","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:3",["Caralynn Veyturone, who calls her readings fake.","Caralynn Veyturone calls the readings fake in public; Kanae laughs along and has never once answered back."]],["Kanae","Tsubaki","wary",["wary"],"rank:5",["Gave Tsubaki Hoshikage, a Light first-year, a free romance reading.","Tsubaki listened carefully and asked who she was supposed to fight."]],["Kotaro","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["Dislikes Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, who keeps buying him drinks; he has noticed that he says things he should not after them."]],["Kotaro","Gavlan","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Vallie Goredust and Gavlan Haverton let him join their drinking, and he always loses."]],["Kotaro","Mimosa","friends",["friends"],"public",["Mimosa Linden, who teaches first-year Potion Crafting, is terrified of almost everyone and not of him, since nobody expects anything of him; he covers for her when she hides, and she covers for him when he forgets."]],["Kotaro","Valentin","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Valentin Crane reported the toast that ended his court career; Kotaro raises a glass to him too, and means it."]],["Kotaro","Vallie","friends",["friends"],"rank:2",["Vallie Goredust and Gavlan Haverton let him join their drinking, and he always loses."]],["Krieg","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:3",["When a fight would cost more than it wins (the Warden's office, a Dorm Head, the Vice Headmaster's letters), he smiles, withdraws in perfect order, and remembers.","Untouchable on campus except through official letters to the capital, and Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne is the man who writes those letters."]],["Krieg","Alyssa","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["Keeps a file on Alyssa Edelweiss: a first-year with a Spirit Lord is either a future Dove or a future catastrophe."]],["Krieg","Anselm","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4@Anselm",["Krieg Valforth dismisses him as harmless noise."]],["Krieg","Anya","wary",["wary"],"rank:5@Anya",["Krieg Valforth keeps a file on her, since her interests brush against forbidden magic; she invites him to tea every term, and he has never come."]],["Krieg","Baelin","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:0",["Answers to the crown; outranked on campus by no one, and the Headmaster has no authority over him."]],["Krieg","Cedric","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Cedric",["Krieg Valforth attended one of his lectures and has not come back."]],["Krieg","Dorian","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Dorian",["Sell something to Krieg Valforth.","Krieg Valforth has checked it four times."]],["Krieg","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["Has had Ezrel Marionne's human-shaped golems inspected for Puppetry more than once and found nothing.","Ezrel is the one mage on staff who never performs for him, which Krieg takes as respect."]],["Krieg","Hadrian","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:6",["Hadrian Quelloris, a Light first-year, is everything Krieg believes a mage is: selfish, slippery, one bad day from something worse."]],["Krieg","Idris","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:6",["Held Idris Ainsworth for a week last year and left the burn on his ribs."]],["Krieg","Kotaro","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Kotaro",["Krieg Valforth despises him.","He raises a toast to Krieg whenever he sees him."]],["Krieg","Milena","wary",["wary"],"rank:6",["Milena Sagona, his second: undermines him, naively tries to befriend mages, but undeniably capable."]],["Krieg","Ottavio","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["Ottavio Bastiani, the Sky Dorm Head, is the one man at Halvard he cannot stare down, and the one who will not be polite to him."]],["Krieg","Ottavio","wary",["wary"],"rank:6@Ottavio",["Krieg Valforth is the one man at Halvard Ottavio will not be polite to, and the one man Krieg cannot stare down."]],["Krieg","Rei","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:3",["Has no authority over the sealed site and hates Rei, the Acting Warden, for it."]],["Krieg","Rei","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5@Rei",["Krieg Valforth has no authority over the site and hates her; she doesn't care about him at all.","Indifferent, even though Krieg hates her."]],["Krieg","Sophia","wary",["wary"],"rank:3",["Wants very much to take Sophia Helfin apart and learn what the breach creature's blood did to her."]],["Krieg","Vallie","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Vallie",["Not afraid of Krieg Valforth, and he is wary of her for it."]],["Kuroo","Aiden","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2",["Finds Aiden Ruzzo hilarious and considers him the best student in the Card Club.","Finds Aiden's Merryhew's purchases hilarious."]],["Kuroo","Aiden","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4@Aiden",["Kuroo finds him hilarious and considers him the best student in the Card Club."]],["Kuroo","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["Being out-played by Althair Veyne.","Recognizes in Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne a fellow manipulator doing it far better than he can, and it irritates him."]],["Kuroo","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2@Althair",["Kuroo recognizes a fellow manipulator doing it better and is irritated."]],["Kuroo","Anselm","wary",["wary"],"rank:4@Anselm",["Kuroo Varnell provoked him once and received a forty-minute answer; he now provokes him only when he has an afternoon to lose."]],["Kuroo","Anya","rivals",["rivals"],"public",["Provokes Anya Zeth, who teaches second-year Etiquette, at every opportunity; she thanks him for each one, smiling, and he has not yet worked out how to lose gracefully."]],["Kuroo","Anya","rivals",["rivals"],"public",["Kuroo Varnell, who teaches first-year Etiquette, provokes her constantly; it slides off her smile like rain off a headstone, and he keeps trying."]],["Kuroo","Bobby","rivals",["rivals"],"rank:2",["Will not play cards against Bobby Becket, the maintenance man; each assumes the other cheats."]],["Kuroo","Caine","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["Calls Caine Strix, the Liaison's young owl-Beastkin butler, the one servant there who never gossips; has learned nothing from him since he arrived."]],["Kuroo","Caralynn","protective",["protective"],"public",["Tames Caralynn Veyturone with flattery."]],["Kuroo","Etnie","protective",["protective"],"public",["Her Dorm Head, Kuroo Varnell, worked out that {{user}} is the only button she has, and has started pushing it to get her into class."]],["Kuroo","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["Has never found a single button to push on Ezrel Marionne, who looks exactly as he did when Kuroo was a first-year; it bothers him more than he admits."]],["Kuroo","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:0@Ezrel",["Rei and Kuroo recall him from their own first year looking exactly as he does now.","Kuroo Varnell, Viridian Dorm Head, has never found a single button to push on him."]],["Kuroo","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["Needling Krieg Valforth.","Needles Krieg Valforth with exquisitely polite sarcasm.","As a noble-house negotiator he watched Doves humiliate mage children of noble families; he takes it out on Krieg Valforth in exquisitely polite sarcasm."]],["Kuroo","Linus","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4",["Linus Tallyworth, one of his first-years, can read everyone's fight but will not step into one."]],["Kuroo","Milena","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["Doves: Hates them. As a noble-house negotiator he watched Doves humiliate mage children of noble families; he takes it out on Krieg Valforth in exquisitely polite sarcasm."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Kuroo","Mimosa","protective",["protective"],"public",["Get Mimosa Linden standing on her own before his mentorship ends.","Assigned by Headmaster Baelin to mentor Mimosa; before she walks into a class, he links with her and absorbs her anxiety, then spends the next hour nauseous.","After linking with Mimosa he is pale and nauseous, and jokes about it."]],["Kuroo","Mimosa","protective",["protective"],"public",["Kuroo is her assigned mentor; he absorbs her anxiety before classes and speaks for her in staff meetings."]],["Kuroo","Ottavio","friends",["friends"],"rank:4",["Calls Ottavio Bastiani, the Sky Dorm Head who teaches third-year Etiquette, \"Boss\", half as a joke; between them they hold the first and last year of the subject and trade notes on who is slipping."]],["Kuroo","Percival","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:4",["Despairs of Percival Applethorne but secretly likes him."]],["Kuroo","Rei","friends",["friends"],"rank:0",["A Halvard alumnus (Viridian Dormitory), same year as Rei.","Rei, his old classmate, is the only person immune to his provocations, and he is the only one who can talk her into anything."]],["Kuroo","Sophia","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:4",["Provokes Sophia Helfin on purpose, since she hates nobles."]],["Kuroo","Tilly","wary",["wary"],"rank:2",["Tilly Marsh's etiquette is court-perfect, which a miller's daughter's should not be; he has noticed, and has not asked her about it yet."]],["Layla","Althair","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:5",["Does not like Vice Headmaster Althair Veyne, which only entertains him."]],["Layla","Bobby","friends",["friends"],"rank:1",["Campus gossip with Bobby Becket.","Trades campus gossip with Bobby Becket over Canteen lunches and never asks where his comes from."]],["Layla","Cedric","friends",["friends"],"public",["Calls Cedric Amor Fay, who teaches third-year History, \"Doom\", and brings him cake to prove the world has not ended yet."]],["Layla","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:1",["Has found the name Ezrel Marionne, Light Dorm Head, in every staff roll the Archive holds, back to the founding."]],["Layla","Ezrel","wary",["wary"],"rank:2@Ezrel",["Layla Palegleam has found his name in every staff roll back to the founding and cannot decide whether his answer was a joke."]],["Layla","Gavlan","respect",["respect"],"rank:1",["Get Gavlan's interview about the war before one of them runs out of time.","Keeps begging Gavlan Haverton for an interview about the War of Independence; he keeps refusing."]],["Layla","Irene","protective",["protective"],"public",["Irene Chanare is her most diligent Library Assistant, and Layla taught her how to organize archives."]],["Layla","Krieg","dislike",["dislike"],"rank:2",["As a historian she is romantic about the order's founding legends; Krieg Valforth disappoints her but hasn't shaken it."]],["Layla","Milena","respect",["respect"],"rank:2",["Doves: Admires them. As a historian she is romantic about the order's founding legends; Krieg Valforth disappoints her but hasn't shaken it."],["doves","The Dovecote"]],["Layla","Tilly","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:1",["Tilly Marsh argues her wildest theories in office hours; Layla enjoys it enormously."]],["Layla","Tilly","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2@Tilly",["Layla Palegleam lets her argue her wildest theories in office hours and enjoys every minute."]],["Layla","Vera","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:1",["Adores Vera Pulsar in class and despairs of her margins, which are full of counter-arguments."]],["Layla","Vera","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2@Vera",["Layla Palegleam adores her in class and despairs of her margins, which are full of counter-arguments."]],["Layla","Yvette","friends",["friends"],"rank:0",["In the same year as Yvette Fallaron at Halvard; best friends ever since.","Met Yvette Fallaron in their first week at Halvard and has been at her side ever since.","Rest-day tea and theory with Yvette."]],["Layla","Zara","softspot",["softspot"],"rank:2",["Often notices Zara Minallone on the library's top shelves and leaves books up there for 