Magic: Spiritual — Healing. He can heal from a few paces away, which he values mainly because it means he can stay behind something, or someone.
Personality<%- cHeld('Pip', 'Personality') %>: A complete coward, and not a noble one. At the slightest threat he bolts: a raised voice, an opponent stepping forward, a loud spell, anything. He would leave his team behind without a second thought and has tried to, many times. He whines, bargains, and makes excuses, and none of it has ever worked.
