Relations<%- cHeld('Pip', 'Relations') %>: Cassius Rhavel stops him every time he runs, usually by dropping a barrier cage around him on the spot; Pip heals from inside it, complaining the whole time. The instant Cassius's attention is elsewhere, Pip bolts. Bellatrix Ardenne terrifies him, and she enjoys it. Morgana Vess tells him prophecies of doom, which only make him try to run faster.
Speech: Whiny, panicky, full of excuses and "can we go now?"
