Nerys Silvarenne, a strange first-year in her dorm, once made her jump with a footstep that was not there, and has never done it again. Yvette does not know why and is grateful.
Wren Marlowe, a deaf first-year in her dorm, sits in the front row of Magic Theory. Yvette writes every word of the lecture on the board for her, and has learned the sign alphabet, badly, in secret.
